            "role": "user",
            "text": "Make a small 2D side-view jump game called Bridge Runner. Keyboard left/right and space jump; cross three visible platforms to a green exit, falling restarts, R resets, HUD explains controls and win. Use simple procedural shapes, no external assets/plugins/network. Fixed 960x540 camera, single level, no sound. Represent the player as object id player with editable numeric speed (220, min 50, max 500) and jump-speed (420, min 200, max 700). Represent the main scene as main-scene bound to scenes/main.tscn. Make each mechanism/object explicit with stable IDs and source bindings. This fully specified isolated test authorizes the MVP plan; do not ask optional questions, use READY unless a real blocker exists."
